# Two calls that split every connectivity problem in half.
# Use them from a terminal in SAP Business Application Studio (or the REST Client
# extension in VS Code) with cds watch --profile bas running.
#
#   first works, second fails -> CAP problem (model, handler, profile)
#   both fail                 -> destination, Cloud Connector or ECC

### 1. ECC directly, through the destination (BAS proxy)
GET http://ecc-gateway.dest/sap/opu/odata/IWFND/SAMPLEFLIGHT/FlightCollection?$top=3&$format=json

### 2. The same data through CAP, as OData V4
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/flight/Flights?$top=3
